#: code:addons/l10n_ve_account_mf/models/account_move.py:0
msgid "This document comes from the PoS order %(order)s, and it is not known whether the fiscal printer printed it. It cannot be printed until it is verified: the PoS verifies it before its next print, or a PoS manager resolves it from the order."
msgstr "Este documento viene del pedido del PdV %(order)s, y no se sabe si la máquina fiscal lo emitió. No se puede imprimir hasta verificarlo: el PdV lo verifica antes de su próxima impresión, o un gerente del PdV lo resuelve desde el pedido."
